## Why This Is Asked
To assess hands-on Azure AI wiring for accessibility use cases, including voice input, multilingual output, and privacy controls, all grounded in a managed KB.

## Key Concepts
- Azure API Management as a gate
- Azure OpenAI with grounding to a versioned KB in Blob via Cognitive Search
- Azure Speech to Text and Text to Speech
- Per-tenant language preferences
- PII redaction and interaction logging

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example flow tying services together
async function handleQuery(audioBlob, language) {
  const text = await speechToText(audioBlob, language);
  const answer = await openai.chat({ messages: [{ role: 'user', content: text }] });
  const tts = await textToSpeech(answer.choices[0].message.content, language);
  return tts;
}
```

